Cell["\<\
An element is degenerate when it pairs to zero with everything.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellFrameLabels->{{Inherited, Inherited}, {Inherited, 
    Cell[
     TextData[{
      "26.09.30: Design review - the function takes the space and one degree, \
because a Sullivan model is infinite-dimensional and the degenerate subspace \
is wanted degree by degree, and it gives a basis as a list of linear \
combinations of basis monomials, the form every other function of the Hodge \
layer takes and gives. Since the pairing has degree n, only degree n-k tests \
degree k, so the basis is the null space of one pairing matrix, computed with \
NullSpace; in a degree with nothing to pair against, such as every degree \
above n of a model, it is the whole monomial basis. The name and the two \
forms were not reviewed by Pavel in R5g, and no alternative was recorded. \
Prior art: the Wolfram Language has no degenerate subspace of a graded \
pairing; NullSpace is the linear algebra it rests on. The engine of the \
verification suites computes the same basis, and T17 pins the function \
against it in degrees 0 to n+2 on the thirteen catalogue models and the \
Kodaira-Thurston model.", "\n\n", 
       Cell[
        BoxData[
         GridBox[{{
            Cell[
             BoxData[
              ButtonBox[
               DynamicBox[
                FEPrivate`FrontEndResource[
                "DocumentationToolsStrings", "Edit"]], BaseStyle -> 
               "TextAnnotationButton"]]], 
            StyleBox[
             RowBox[{
               DynamicBox[
                FEPrivate`FrontEndResource[
                "DocumentationToolsStrings", "LastAnnotator"]], "pavel"}], 
             "TextAnnotator"], 
            Cell[
             BoxData[
              ButtonBox[
               DynamicBox[
                FEPrivate`FrontEndResource[
                "DocumentationToolsStrings", "Delete"]], BaseStyle -> 
               "TextAnnotationRemoveButton"]]], ""}}, 
          GridBoxAlignment -> {
           "Columns" -> {Left, Left, Right, Right}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}}, 
          GridBoxItemSize -> {"Columns" -> {
              Scaled[0.15], 
              Scaled[0.68], 
              Scaled[0.15], 
              Scaled[0.02]}}]]], "\n"}], "TextAnnotation", 
     CellSize -> {590, Inherited}]}},
 CellTags->"TextAnnotation",
 CellID->307391264,ExpressionUUID->"125d8a41-2c43-4f7a-ad8f-4c20eb72a541"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Since the pairing has degree ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["n", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "76da1c8e-3225-4317-b8a4-9ce983489665"],
 ", only degree ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["n", "TI"], "-", 
    StyleBox["k", "TI"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "2cb6ef30-a388-4831-8794-b57c323a1d1d"],
 " tests degree ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["k", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "cf520c28-856f-4514-bc92-df690de56428"],
 ", and the basis is the null space of one pairing matrix."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"a8c77487-1bd8-4557-b0c2-7c209c67e238"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The basis elements are linear combinations of the basis monomials of degree \
",
 StyleBox["k", "TI"],
 "."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"690f6dc2-725f-4136-9cdd-e01b6116d583"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "In a degree with no basis elements of degree ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["n", "TI"], "-", 
    StyleBox["k", "TI"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "c4d27f55-b89d-439a-b0ff-f0b19528549b"],
 ", the whole degree is degenerate. For a model this holds in every degree \
above ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["n", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "042f5335-ad1a-49b1-93bc-64331b1e985a"],
 "."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"2e21762c-69c7-46ac-8f5a-11d770709465"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["V", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["deg",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "2a0e294b-aa10-4d72-b121-6413049eaccb"],
 " is closed under the differential, because ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"\[LeftAngleBracket]", 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["d",
       FontSlant->"Plain"], 
      SubscriptBox[
       StyleBox["v", "TI"], "1"], ",", 
      SubscriptBox[
       StyleBox["v", "TI"], "2"]}], "\[RightAngleBracket]"}], "\[LongEqual]", 
    "\[PlusMinus]", 
    RowBox[{"\[LeftAngleBracket]", 
     RowBox[{
      SubscriptBox[
       StyleBox["v", "TI"], "1"], ",", 
      StyleBox["d",
       FontSlant->"Plain"], 
      SubscriptBox[
       StyleBox["v", "TI"], "2"]}], "\[RightAngleBracket]"}]}], 
   TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "105538aa-8b0c-4fb2-ad40-f20af097de5f"],
 "."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"c564fd62-7107-4265-95af-5d20c4cd4567"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "When there is a product, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["V", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["deg",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "d545aeaf-6f41-4cc6-b566-134c02d7dd80"],
 " is an ideal, because ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"\[LeftAngleBracket]", 
     RowBox[{
      SubscriptBox[
       StyleBox["v", "TI"], "1"], 
      SubscriptBox[
       StyleBox["v", "TI"], "2"], ",", 
      SubscriptBox[
       StyleBox["v", "TI"], "3"]}], "\[RightAngleBracket]"}], "\[LongEqual]", 
    
    RowBox[{"\[LeftAngleBracket]", 
     RowBox[{
      SubscriptBox[
       StyleBox["v", "TI"], "1"], ",", 
      SubscriptBox[
       StyleBox["v", "TI"], "2"], 
      SubscriptBox[
       StyleBox["v", "TI"], "3"]}], "\[RightAngleBracket]"}]}], 
   TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "698a4483-c5c9-4b38-a056-c62e6ef5f083"],
 ". It is then a differential graded ideal, and the quotient by it is again a \
differential graded algebra, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["NondegenerateQuotient"]], 
    "paclet:ChernSimons/ref/NondegenerateQuotient", 
    "ChernSimons Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "df75c014-fd5e-4029-83f9-884c32875a9a"],
 "."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"7a43c9c6-7dc2-4ebc-a01b-05934734268e"]
}, Open  ]],

